  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>During the reaction, first addition of water takes place according to Markownikoff's rule, alcohol is formed, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> acts as an oxidising agents which converts alcohol into ketone, then Wolf Kishner reduction occurs.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/acef85d2-00e3-4c5c-8a36-c3ea1dc1953a.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 266px;\"/></p><p>Hence option A is the answer.</p>",
    "image": null
